    "%@ %@ 서로 궁금한 것을 물어봐요:\n\n\"그때 왜 그랬어?\"\n\"내가 어떻게 해 줬으면 좋겠어?\"\n\n⭐ 규칙: 한 사람씩 차례대로, 화내지 않고!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The %@ and the %@ ask each other questions:\n\n“Why did you do that?”\n“What would you like me to do?”\n\n⭐ Rule: One at a time, and no getting angry!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The %@ and the %@ ask each other questions:\n\n“Why did you do that?”\n“What would you like me to do?”\n\n⭐ Rule: One at a time, and no getting angry!"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@と%@が、おたがいに聞きたいことを質問します：\n\n「あのとき、どうしてそうしたの？」\n「どうしてほしい？」\n\n⭐ ルール：ひとりずつ順番に、怒らずに！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@和%@互相问想知道的事：\n\n“那时候你为什么那样做？”\n“你希望我怎么做？”\n\n⭐ 规则：一个一个轮流说，不发脾气！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@和%@互相問想知道的事：\n\n「那時候你為什麼那樣做？」\n「你希望我怎麼做？」\n\n⭐ 規則：一個一個輪流說，不發脾氣！"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ и %@ задают друг другу вопросы:\n\n«Почему так вышло?»\n«Что мне сделать, чтобы тебе стало лучше?»\n\n⭐ Правила: по очереди и без злости!"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ y %@, haceos preguntas:\n\n«¿Por qué lo hiciste?»\n«¿Qué te gustaría que hiciera?»\n\n⭐ Regla: de uno en uno, ¡sin enfadarse!"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ ↔ %@ – fragt euch gegenseitig:\n\n„Warum hast du das damals gemacht?“\n„Was wünschst du dir von mir?“\n\n⭐ Regel: einer nach dem anderen und ohne wütend zu werden!"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ et %@, posez-vous des questions :\n\n« Pourquoi tu as fait ça ? »\n« Qu’est-ce que tu voudrais que je fasse ? »\n\n⭐ Règle : chacun son tour, sans se fâcher !"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ e %@, fatevi delle domande:\n\n«Perché l’hai fatto?»\n«Cosa vorresti che facessi?»\n\n⭐ Regola: uno alla volta, senza arrabbiarsi!"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ e %@, perguntem um ao outro o que querem saber:\n\n\"Por que você fez aquilo?\"\n\"O que você gostaria que eu fizesse?\"\n\n⭐ Regra: um de cada vez, sem ficar bravo!"
