    "%@ 어떤 벌칙이 좋을지 말해요:\n\n\"%@에게 다음 벌칙을 내려 주시기 바랍니다.\n%@\"\n\n⭐ 벌칙은 너무 무겁지 않게, 지킬 수 있는 것으로!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The %@ says what penalty would be fair:\n\n“I ask that the %@ be given this penalty:\n%@”\n\n⭐ Keep it light, and make it something they can really do!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The %@ says what penalty would be fair:\n\n“I ask that the %@ be given this penalty:\n%@”\n\n⭐ Keep it light, and make it something they can really do!"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@が、どんな罰がいいかを伝えます：\n\n「%@に、次の罰をお願いします。\n%@」\n\n⭐ 罰は重すぎず、守れるものに！"
