    "%@ 이야기해요:\n\n• 정말 그런 일이 있었나요? 맞나요, 아닌가요?\n• 왜 그렇게 했나요? 내 생각을 이야기해요.\n\n⭐ 규칙: 솔직하게 말하기, 소리 지르지 않기!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Now the %@ talks:\n\n• Did it really happen? Is it true or not?\n• Why did you do it? Say what you think.\n\n⭐ Rule: Be honest, and no shouting!"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Now the %@ talks:\n\n• Did it really happen? Is it true or not?\n• Why did you do it? Say what you think.\n\n⭐ Rule: Be honest, and no shouting!"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@が話します：\n\n・本当にそんなことがありましたか？ 合っていますか、ちがいますか？\n・どうしてそうしたのですか？ 自分の考えを話そう。\n\n⭐ ルール：正直に話す、大きな声を出さない！"
